  "_on_vegan_coverage": "Only a handful of these are vegan-viable, and that is a consequence of a deliberate choice elsewhere rather than an oversight here. ingestion/lineage_b.py maps the catalogue's 'Fresh Milk & Plant Milk' category to `dairy` wholesale, because the source does not separate oat milk from cow's milk and over-excluding is the safe direction for a vegan. So plant milks are unavailable to a vegan plan, and vegan recipes here are built from produce, pantry and grains only. Per-product allergen tagging (legacy 11.7) is what would lift it; widening the category map to improve variety would trade a safety property for a menu, which is the wrong way round."
}
